1
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:09,600
My name is Cao Cao.

2
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,530
I'm the descendant of the
famous Cao Cao of the Three Kingdoms, it seems.

3
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,070
Were you the ones who took my mother?!

4
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,620
What do you plan to do with her?

5
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:22,620
Your mother will help us preform an experiment.

6
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,420
Experiment, you say?

7
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,040
But before that, I came to greet Governor-General
Azazel and the Red Dragon Emperor.

8
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,420
I wish to exchange blows.

9
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,880
No problem.

10
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:36,220
Before we begin, we'd like you
to return their great leader.

11
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:39,850
We have some important
things to establish with her.

12
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,460
Well, then. Please try and <i>take</i> her from us.

