No, humans <i>must</i> be the ones to defeat them.

7376
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:39,540
This is a little challenge
for the weak humankind.

7377
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:45,330
I just wanted to see how far I could
go as a human among the gods.

7378
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,710
While staying human...

7379
