What?

7412
00:11:37,130 --> 00:11:38,460
Until we meet again.

7413
00:11:39,210 --> 00:11:39,840
Everyone!

7414
00:11:40,050 --> 00:11:41,800
The space we're in is disappearing!

7415
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:43,340
Put away your weapons!

7416
00:11:58,030 --> 00:12:00,490
My mother... Why?!

7417
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,960
Hey, what in the world is this?

7418
00:12:20,130 --> 00:12:22,130
You told me to take pictures of you, so I did!

7419
00:12:22,130 --> 00:12:24,300
Take some proper pictures!

7420
00:12:24,300 --> 00:12:26,850
These are precious memories of the school trip!

7421
00:12:26,850 --> 00:12:27,890
Yeah. Yeah.

7422
00:12:27,890 --> 00:12:29,970
Also, take pictures that make me look more sexy!

7423
00:12:31,180 --> 00:12:33,600
I took some good ones, too!

7424
00:12:33,730 --> 00:12:34,980
How nice.

7425
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:37,190
Oh, I look really cool here!

7426
00:12:37,190 --> 00:12:38,570
Sorry, an accidental shot.

7427
00:12:38,570 --> 00:12:39,270
Hey!

7428
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:40,320
Oh, it's me!

7429
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,360
This is a good one.

7430
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:41,990
Yes.

7431
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,650
Oh, that place.

7432
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:45,910
The coffee there was delicious!

7433
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:47,740
Yeah, it really warmed me up.

7434
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:48,700
--Okay! Let's look at the pictures
of the places we visited today!

7435
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:51,870
--We're all going home, no matter what.
--Okay! Let's look at the pictures
of the places we visited today!

7436
00:12:51,870 --> 00:12:54,360
Back to Kuoh Academy,
where President is waiting for us.

7437
00:12:55,670 --> 00:12:58,960
We mobilized all the firepower we could

7438
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:02,280
and put them on full alert around
Nijo castle and Kyoto station.

7439
00:13:03,090 --> 00:13:05,470
The Hero Faction has not
made any movements yet,

7440
00:13:05,470 --> 00:13:08,470
but there have been confirmations
of unsettling chi disturbances.

7441
00:13:08,470 --> 00:13:10,470
Unsettling chi disturbances?

7442
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:18,270
Kyoto is historically known for being built
with <i>onmyoudou</i> and feng shui in mind.

7443
00:13:18,270 --> 00:13:21,230
Because of that, there are
power spots all over the city.

7444
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:26,030
However, that chi is flowing from
those spots toward Nijo castle.

7445
00:13:26,030 --> 00:13:28,450
So, what's going to happen?

7446
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:30,660
Right now, we don't really know.

7447
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:33,050
All we know is that it
probably isn't anything good.

7448
00:13:33,700 --> 00:13:35,710
Well, then. Here's the plan.

7449
00:13:35,710 --> 00:13:38,380
The Sitri family will be on
standby in the Kyoto area.

7450
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:39,630
Protect this hotel.

7451
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:40,630
Yes!

7452
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:43,510
The Gremory family and
Irina will be our offense.

7453
00:13:43,510 --> 00:13:45,550
I will have all of you head to Nijo castle.

7454
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:46,300
Yes!

7455
