their full fighting capabilities.

7457
00:13:53,850 --> 00:13:55,730
I won't send you in alone.

7458
00:13:55,730 --> 00:13:59,440
I've called in a helper who is good
at dealing with this kind of thing.

7459
00:13:59,940 --> 00:14:01,940
Helper? Who is it?

7460
00:14:02,270 --> 00:14:06,010
Well, just keep in mind a
monstrous person is coming.

7461
00:14:06,610 --> 00:14:10,030
Try to hold your ground until then.

7462
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:11,860
