Sorry. This is the best I can do.

7467
00:14:22,460 --> 00:14:26,130
I will give one to each group. Use it wisely.

7468
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:27,590
And, Saji.

7469
00:14:27,590 --> 00:14:28,510
Yes.

7470
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:30,390
Join the Gremory family.

7471
00:14:30,390 --> 00:14:31,180
Huh?

7472
00:14:31,180 --> 00:14:35,060
Your Vritra's dragon king form is useful.

7473
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:36,850
Support Issei and the others.

7474
00:14:37,140 --> 00:14:38,190
But...

7475
00:14:38,190 --> 00:14:42,610
Bring Saji back if he goes out of control, Issei.

7476
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:43,320
Yes!

7477
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:44,980
I'm depending on you.

7478
00:14:44,980 --> 00:14:49,490
You caused me so much pain as
an enemy during the Sitri game,

7479
00:14:49,490 --> 00:14:51,740
so having you as an ally is really reassuring.

7480
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:52,910
Hyodo...

7481
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:59,330
As I said earlier, the devils, angels,
fallen angels, and <i>youkai</i> in Kyoto

7482
00:14:59,330 --> 00:15:01,790
have created a large-scale
encirclement for the Hero Faction.

7483
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:04,630
Leave their supervision to me!

7484
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:08,050
If any bad children try to
get out, we'll punish them!

7485
00:15:08,340 --> 00:15:10,260
And that's the plan.

7486
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:14,260
After we disperse, and preparations
are complete, head to your locations quickly.

7487
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:16,470
I'll be here supervising all the groups.

7488
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:19,970
I can't go with you,
so don't any of you die on me.

7489
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:23,060
A school trip doesn't end
until you safely get back home.

7490
00:15:23,060 --> 00:15:25,900
We will all protect Kyoto
with our lives! Got it?!

7491
00:15:26,110 --> 00:15:26,830
Yes!

7492
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:32,490
We finally finished!

7493
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:36,700
I cannot believe that members of
the Old Satan Faction had snuck in.

7494
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:39,410
President?

7495
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,790
My heart feels a little uneasy.

7496
00:15:42,790 --> 00:15:44,590
Do you sense an enemy nearby?

7497
00:15:45,210 --> 00:15:48,320
That's not it. It's about Issei.

7498
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:56,350
True, there are probably many cute
girls that are Issei's type in Kyoto.

7499
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:58,060
I'm worried.

7500
00:15:59,850 --> 00:16:01,240
Hey, Issei!

7501
00:16:02,270 --> 00:16:03,050
Yes.

7502
00:16:03,900 --> 00:16:04,740
What is it?

7503
00:16:05,190 --> 00:16:09,070
Oh, there was a molester case
in front of the hotel a bit ago.

7504
00:16:09,860 --> 00:16:13,490
I happened to be passing by,
so I helped subdue the man.

7505
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:17,120
This popped out of his body.

7506
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,450
It can't be...

7507
00:16:18,450 --> 00:16:19,660
What is it, Ddraig?

7508
00:16:19,660 --> 00:16:23,580
That is what jumped out
of you in the bullet train.

7509
00:16:23,580 --> 00:16:25,040
It was what was in the box.

7510
00:16:30,090 --> 00:16:32,420
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What did you say?!

7511
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:34,090
I thought so.

7512
00:16:34,090 --> 00:16:39,140
When I examined it, I could
feel your aura exuding from it.

7513
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:41,350
Yes. I'm positive.

7514
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:44,350
No, wait. What is this?!

7515
00:16:44,350 --> 00:16:45,310
What's wrong?

7516
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:47,940
This potential of yours.

7517
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:52,740
It seems it travelled around Kyoto
by jumping from person to person.

7518
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,990
All while grabbing breasts along the way.

7519
00:16:58,120 --> 00:17:04,120
I see. Your "potential" is the cause of the
molester cases that have been happening!

7520
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:05,620
No way...

7521
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:09,210
So, Ddraig. What power does this thing have?

7522
00:17:09,210 --> 00:17:13,550
I do not know. All I can
tell is that it is powerful...

7523
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:20,510
It seems we'll have to follow-up on all the
people who became molesters because of Issei.

7524
00:17:20,510 --> 00:17:22,600
Sorry for all the trouble.

7525
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:30,820
She still has something
left in her? How terrible.

7526
00:17:33,530 --> 00:17:34,400
What's wrong?

7527
00:17:35,150 --> 00:17:38,490
I thought about something
that isn't very like me.

7528
00:17:39,780 --> 00:17:42,160
I wonder what makes someone a hero?

7529
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:44,000
When I was human,

7530
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:49,210
an average person like me thought
heroes were something to be envied.

7531
00:17:49,210 --> 00:17:55,380
What? You started thinking about
a devil like yourself and heroes?

7532
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:59,090
Jeez. Just what do you want to become?
What do you want to do?

7533
00:17:59,090 --> 00:18:02,930
Of course, I want to become a
high-ranking devil and the Harem King!

7534
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:05,730
Just kidding!

7535
00:18:05,730 --> 00:18:09,060
Right now, I just want to work hard
for President and my friends.

7536
00:18:09,610 --> 00:18:13,690
That's good enough. You should just stay you.

7537
00:18:13,690 --> 00:18:15,990
That is what will help your friends grow.

7538
00:18:17,280 --> 00:18:22,740
I understand! I, Hyoudou Issei,
will rush forward with my friends!

7539
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,710
Red Dragon Emperor!

7540
00:18:28,710 --> 00:18:30,580
Kunou?! Why are you here?

7541
00:18:30,750 --> 00:18:32,040
I shall go with you!

7542
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:35,670
Weren't you told to wait in the shadows
of Kyoto because it's dangerous?

7543
00:18:35,670 --> 00:18:38,050
I want to be the one to save Mother!

7544
00:18:38,050 --> 00:18:41,180
Please! Take me with you! I'm begging you!

7545
00:18:45,350 --> 00:18:50,200
Then, let's go together!
We might need your help.

7546
00:18:59,070 --> 00:19:00,070
This is...

7547
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:02,740
Looks like we got pulled in again.

7548
00:19:06,290 --> 00:19:08,210
Hey, Kiba. Where are you right now?

7549
00:19:08,210 --> 00:19:09,790
We're at the Kyoto Imperial Palace.

7550
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:12,330
Rossweisse and Saji are with me.
How about you?

7551
00:19:12,540 --> 00:19:15,750
I'm with Kunou on a subway
platform in Kyoto Station.

7552
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:18,510
So, why don't we meet up at Nijo Castle?

7553
00:19:18,510 --> 00:19:19,300
Yeah.

7554
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:22,050
Roger. Were you able to
contact Asia and the others?

7555
00:19:22,050 --> 00:19:22,800
Leave it to me!

7556
00:19:23,220 --> 00:19:25,390
And, Issei.

7557
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:28,480
Since the President isn't here
right now, you are our King.

7558
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,290
Huh?

7559
00:19:29,850 --> 00:19:31,610
I was sure after Togetsukyo Bridge.

7560
00:19:32,230 --> 00:19:36,140
We managed to make it out safely
because of your quick decisions.

7561
00:19:36,650 --> 00:19:39,650
So, please lead us again tonight.

7562
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:41,800
Got it.

7563
00:19:43,070 --> 00:19:46,140
Asia? Yeah. Be careful.

7564
00:19:47,540 --> 00:19:48,660
It's okay.

7565
00:19:48,660 --> 00:19:51,500
The church trio are all together.

7566
00:19:51,500 --> 00:19:53,500
Thank goodness.

7567
00:19:55,250 --> 00:19:58,380
Welsh Dragon Balance Breaker!

7568
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:08,100
Kunou, we'll definitely save your mother.

7569
00:20:08,100 --> 00:20:11,190
So, make sure to stay by
my side the entire time.

7570
00:20:11,190 --> 00:20:13,250
I'll protect you, Kunou.

7571
00:20:13,690 --> 00:20:16,650
Yes, I shall leave things to you.

7572
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:25,530
I was waiting for you, Red Dragon Emperor.

7573
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:28,290
You don't remember me, do you?

7574
00:20:28,290 --> 00:20:30,000
Yeah. Sorry.

7575
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,390
Well, of course you don't.

7576
00:20:31,910 --> 00:20:37,000
To you, I was a small fry that
wasn't even worth remembering.

7577
00:20:41,170 --> 00:20:45,340
I remember now! The possessor of a
Sacred Gear that could control shadows!

7578
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:48,140
That's right! This time, I will show you...

7579
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:50,210
...the true power of a shadow user!

7580
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:52,180
Balance Break!

7581
00:21:07,950 --> 00:21:10,450
Well? I look like you, right?

7582
00:21:10,450 --> 00:21:15,180
Fighting you last time made me
want a set of armor like yours.

7583
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:20,750
And so, I obtained Night Reflection Death Cross.

7584
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:24,220
Now, let us continue our fight from before!

7585
00:21:25,380 --> 00:21:26,760
Bring it on!

7586
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:57,120
You can no longer escape!

7587
00:21:58,130 --> 00:21:59,670
Red Dragon Emperor!

